  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>By expansion of the determinant, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>which is true for <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> must be an equilateral triangle<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
